    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29411" root="عض" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَضِيضٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِضَاضٌ</span>, in three places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  (assumed tropical:)  <i>An
associate; a companion:</i> or <i>an equal in age:</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرِينٌ</span>: (O, K:) of another. (O, TA.) See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِضٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Applied to waters, <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَضُوضٌ</span>,
q. v. (“ Nawádir ” of AA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  In the A and K,
written by mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَضْعَضٌ</span>, as mentioned
above, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِضٌّ</span>. (TA.)


